0344871617182894_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s8cL44uLs1MQ7kNvwEyE3iV&_nc_oc=Adp2Y3pPXrigD4pMJE2lwmwv57i0b6Nltu6f9asjfCsePr7Z0gB8OCtkQ-ku-3pDkn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3UoDoV8WyNs_lUJbpZqpKsZIooRzaY5VELIQVdWdX1fg&oe=69F0D2B4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Grow A Company", "keywords": ["Horror", "Grow", "Lethal", "Upgrade", "Factory"], "long_description": "**Grow A Company** \u2013 Build, Sell, Survive... maybe even *Thrive.*\nSounds familiar? That\u2019s because it is; and it\u2019s cursed.\n\nIn Grow A Company, you and your friends run a sketchy underground factory, churning out bizarre \u201cfear gear\u201d while trying not to disappoint the Company.\n\n\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade your station\n\ud83e\uddea Scan, sort, and sell strange items\n\ud83c\udf31 Climb the tech tree and unlock controlled chaos\n\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Play solo or with others; friends not required\n\nBecome the best employee you can be...\nOr the last one alive.", "short_description": "Grow A Company \u2013 Build, Sell, Survive... maybe even Thrive.\nSounds familiar? That\u2019s because it is; and it\u2019s cursed.\n\nIn Grow A Company, you and your friends run a sketchy underground factory, churning out bizarre \u201cfear gear\u201d while trying not to disappoint the Company.\n\n\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade your station\n\ud83e\uddea Scan, sort, and sell strange items\n\ud83c\udf31 Climb the tech tree and unlock controlled chaos\n\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Play solo or with others; friends not required\n\nBecome the best employee you can be...\nOr the last one alive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://growacompany.online/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://growacompany.online/termsofservice", "publisher_name": "Maliba Entertainment ", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/bpZrJRAmmj", "website_url": "https://growacompany.online/", "ca